OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize #12,000 of fireworks
OL,4,Aset to be sold online before Bonfire
OL,5,ANight
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice have seized 350kg (772lbs) of
OL,8,Ffireworks worth around #12,000 that
OL,9,Fwere set to be sold online before
OL,10,FBonfire Night.
OL,12,FOfficers acting on intelligence found
OL,13,Fthe pyrotechnics when they raided a
OL,14,Fproperty in the Penilee area of Glasgow
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FPolice Scotland said some of the
OL,18,Ffireworks had the capacity to fire 600
OL,19,Findividual rockets.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
